er at  being able to put that behind you  focusing on the best drives and make it  the next play and I think that comes  from experience the call to Julio that  won the game against the Eagles  is that a call or an autumn oh I always  say you know in in our play call  we had an empty formation running  basically out to be you know zone  organics and then we had an alert that  if they went to cover zero we were going  to the play that we ran and so it's a  building inaudible I guess the best way  to describe it  oh you're trying to dumb it down so I  can understand it Matt I was the  starting quarterback as a freshman on  the Freshman team in high school just  letting you know so I think how did you  how did your audible work how did you  guys honorable in that system for your  system gonna did you create the system I  was the system man basically I was  saying Des Moines I didn't say Omaha I  was saying Des Moines Des Moines just to  let you know to come do you have a  favorite audible like word so you know  it's probably gonna have to get changed  from last night we all could have  enjoyed of these fellows after that game  is that one could you do one for us  against the Colts we have one of our  guys here football guy named McLovin  could you use McLovin as an audible  maybe against the Colts here yeah I will  add something to squeak after I finished  with this interview I'm gonna call Turk  cutter and make sure we have something  that they're called that mclovin checks  and I'm sure Dirk is gonna go oh yeah  yeah yeah hell yeah I I hope to hear you  like that he's pretty open about that oh  my god you'll go down and Dan Patrick  show history if you do yes McLovin and  what this might be asking for too much  brick it can I design the play as well  no no no no no we just want we just want  the audible maybe Calvin really go along  I'm just saying wow that's great  hey how about throw the banner Julio  that's probably either of those two  suggestions are probably go